# The locale dictionaries are written by scripts/generate-locales.mjs, which
# always emits LF. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# gets CRLF in the working tree and every regeneration reports all five files
# as modified — which also breaks the validator's guarantee that regenerating
# from the content source is a no-op.
#
# Scoped to the generated files rather than the whole repository: renormalizing
# everything would rewrite unrelated history-adjacent files for no benefit here.
content/locales/*.ts eol=lf
